  "nonogramCoachHintTitle": "Hint",
  "nonogramCoachHintBody": "Fills 5 correct squares for you (squares that should be filled but aren't yet), picked at random across the board. They get a star: they can't be changed and are kept even if you restart. You get 3 per puzzle.",
  "nonogramCoachWandTitle": "Magic wand",
  "nonogramCoachWandBody": "Tap the wand, then tap the clues of any row or column: the answer for that whole line is revealed and marked with a star, kept even if you restart. You get 1 per puzzle.",
  "nonogramCoachModeTitle": "Fill or X",
  "nonogramCoachModeBody": "Choose what a tap does: fill the square, or mark it with an X to remember it is empty. Tap the button to switch. Drag across the grid to fill or mark many squares at once.",
  "nonogramCoachLongPressTitle": "Press and hold for the opposite",
  "nonogramCoachLongPressBody": "Press and hold a square to do the opposite of the current mode: X while filling, fill while marking. A short vibration means it's done and you can let go.",
  "nonogramCoachScrollTitle": "Moving around big puzzles",
  "nonogramCoachScrollBody": "Big puzzles don't fit on screen: drag with two fingers, or drag from the empty space outside the grid to move the board. Drag on the clues to see hidden numbers (the \"+N\" in the corner shows how many).",
