  "nonogramTutorialRulesDoneTitle": "You know the rules!",
  "nonogramTutorialRulesDone": "Next, let's practice the controls and helpers on another puzzle: drag to fill quickly, press and hold to mark, hints and the magic wand.",
  "nonogramTutorialContinue": "Continue",
  "nonogramTutorialLater": "Later, just play",
  "nonogramTutorialDragRow": "Tip: drag your finger across squares to fill them in one go. The top row has 5, so drag across the whole row!",
  "nonogramTutorialLongPressMark": "1 1 1 fits these 5 squares exactly, so the 2nd and 4th squares must be empty. No need to switch modes: press and hold each one to mark it with an X. A short vibration means it's done.",
